  <entity00159023:DescriptionOfBondsIssuedOfDisclosureOfReconciliationOfChangesInBondsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfReconciliationOfChangesInBondsTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00159023_Six01StUnsecuredCorporateBondsCapitalExpendituresMemberOfBondsIssuedMemberOfDisclosureOfReconciliationOfChangesInBondsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">지배기업의 연결대상 종속기업인 SK브로드밴드(주)가 발행한 무보증사채입니다.</entity00159023:DescriptionOfBondsIssuedOfDisclosureOfReconciliationOfChangesInBondsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfReconciliationOfChangesInBondsTableOfItems>
