  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfGoodsOrServicesThatEntityHasPromisedToTransfer contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_TimingOfTransferOfGoodsOrServicesAxis_ifrs-full_GoodsOrServicesTransferredOverTimeMember_ifrs-full_SegmentsAxis_entity00159023_WiredTelecommunicationBusinessMemberOfTelecommunicationBusinessMemberOfDisclosureOfGainsLossesByCategoriesOfRevenueAndCashFlowsOfGroupTableOfMember_ifrs-full_ProductsAndServicesAxis_entity00159023_IptvMemberOfProductsAndServicesDomainOfDisclosureOfGainsLossesByCategoriesOfRevenueAndCashFlowsOfGroupTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">IPTV 관련 서비스 제공으로 수령하는 대가 등으로 구성되어 있습니다.</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfGoodsOrServicesThatEntityHasPromisedToTransfer>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfGoodsOrServicesThatEntityHasPromisedToTransfer contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_TimingOfTransferOfGoodsOrServicesAxis_ifrs-full_GoodsOrServicesTransferredOverTimeMember_ifrs-full_SegmentsAxis_entity00159023_WirelessTelecommunicationBusinessMemberOfTelecommunicationBusinessMemberOfDisclosureOfGainsLossesByCategoriesOfRevenueAndCashFlowsOfGroupTableOfMember_ifrs-full_ProductsAndServicesAxis_entity00159023_OtherProductsAndServicesMemberOfProductsAndServicesDomainOfDisclosureOfGainsLossesByCategoriesOfRevenueAndCashFlowsOfGroupTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">청구 및 수납대행, 솔루션 서비스 제공으로 수령하는 대가 등으로 구성되어 있습니다.</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfGoodsOrServicesThatEntityHasPromisedToTransfer>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfGoodsOrServicesThatEntityHasPromisedToTransfer contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_TimingOfTransferOfGoodsOrServicesAxis_ifrs-full_GoodsOrServicesTransferredOverTimeMember_ifrs-full_SegmentsAxis_entity00159023_WirelessTelecommunicationBusinessMemberOfTelecommunicationBusinessMemberOfDisclosureOfGainsLossesByCategoriesOfRevenueAndCashFlowsOfGroupTableOfMember_ifrs-full_ProductsAndServicesAxis_entity00159023_WirelessTelecommunicationMemberOfProductsAndServicesDomainOfDisclosureOfGainsLossesByCategoriesOfRevenueAndCashFlowsOfGroupTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">음성통화, 무선데이터 서비스의 제공으로 무선통신서비스 가입자에게 수령하는대가 등으로 구성되어 있습니다.</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfGoodsOrServicesThatEntityHasPromisedToTransfer>
